      "source": [
        "# Understnding the business problem"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ccUVcNIpxk8S"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The company whimsy and wonder , wants to curate a mystery box containing 3 random items from curated inventory pool . And the mystery box is planned to be out for the market with the price level of 45 $.     \n",
        "\n",
        "Here is the business problem the company wants to know there win probability:\n",
        "- whether the customer gets good value from the box\n",
        "- whether the store still makes profit\n",
        "\n",
        "Since the items are random, each box can be different.  \n",
        "Because of that, I use simulation to test many possible box combinations instead of just one."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7xKYBAC_xsDs"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "So here is the first requirment for this project:\n",
        "   - creating a mock dataset of 30 unique boutique items with retail prices ranging from 10 dollar to 75 dollar , and associate wholecasete costs (standard 50 %)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "-noLjpqKy-F7"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "let us first create a list with the unique items of our boutique and collectible shop ."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "eZjITJAb0q_E"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
