    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "next let us give each items their randomly generated retail price between 10 dollar and 75 dollar and there must be an associated whole sum price which is the price on which the shop pays the supplier to buy the item and we are asked to make this whole sum price 50 percent of the retail sale price.\n",
        "      \n",
        "  - task one : let me generate a retail sales price randomly using numpy library randint method\n",
        "  - task two calculate the 50 % od this retail price for the wholesum price"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "L8V0zLas1mrb"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "before that since we are generating random numbers the result will be different each time we run it so let us seed random"
