      "source": [
        "let us understand what the statistical analysis is aking us to do in the project requirment .\n",
        "  -  statistical : analysis is aking us to find the total_retail value and the store profite margin per each box\n",
        "           \n",
        "       -  Total_Retail = adding the three items retail price .\n",
        "       -  Total_wholesale = adding the wholesale cost for each combinations in our simulation data set\n",
        "\n",
        "       next calculating the\n",
        "\n",
        "        - customer value gap - which is total_retail of the items minus 45 dollar\n",
        "        - store profit margin - which is 45 dollar minus total wholesale cost of the 3 items\n",
        "\n",
        "        so now let us create those features and add them to our simulation box\n"
      ],
